<caml:Content xmlns:caml="http://lc.ca.gov/legalservices/schemas/caml.1#"><p>In any suit brought under the provisions of subdivision (b) or (c) of Section 1798.45, the agency shall be liable to the individual in an amount equal to the sum of:</p><p>(a)<span class="EnSpace"/>Actual damages sustained by the individual, including damages for mental suffering.</p><p>(b)<span class="EnSpace"/>The costs of the action together with reasonable attorney’s fees as determined by the court.</p></caml:Content>